Package: phonebridge
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, v4l2loopback-dkms | v4l2loopback-utils
Recommends: pipewire, pipewire-pulse
Description: USB webcam and microphone bridge for Android
 PhoneBridge turns an Android phone into a USB webcam and microphone
 for Linux. It streams H.264 video and PCM audio over USB and exposes
 them as a virtual camera (v4l2loopback) and virtual microphone (PipeWire).
 .
 Features:
  - H.264 video capture from Android camera
  - PCM audio capture from Android microphone
  - Virtual webcam via v4l2loopback
  - Virtual microphone via PipeWire
  - GTK4 status GUI
  - Low-latency USB streaming
